! mcp_bootstrap_p422.strap -- MCP printed page 422: $EOJ's dummy tables
! for the un-assignment of the rejected job (T DSIO .. T WORM).
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.172, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22$EOJ  CARD ID ZF000255  DIST. OF 3/01
!  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 422"; the heading row's LOCATION field is blank.
! Card series ZF (ZF000255 .. ZF000276), still PUNID 22$EOJ.
!
! THE PAGE.  Contiguous from 022267.40 (CNOP) to 022325.00 (T WORM, a
! full word), then blank paper.  The next location, 022326.00, is the
! $EOJ TMOVE the staged decks reference (022326.0).
!   lines 1-4    remark banner; line 2 THE DUMMY TABLES FOR THE
!                UN-ASSIGNMENT OF THE REJECTED JOB.
!   line  5      CNOP (000000.30, half-word fill).
!   lines 6-9    T DSIO: four VFs to the tables below.
!   lines 11-25  the tables (DRZ(N)s, VFs, two DD(BU,7),(16)01, an XW).
!   line  27     T WORM XW,(.26)3.
! Every symbol the page references is defined on the page: no external
! SYNs.  Spellings TDSIO/TCAT/TBIRD/TCOT/TBOID/TWORM agree with the
! volume-1 copy (pp.67-75) and the staged $EOJ decks (pp.405/406).
!
! >>> OPEN ROUNDS. <<<  Every "C" in the octal/hex fields (022267.4C,
! 000000.30 CC, 022270.CC ...) is the drum's open 0; the only bytes it
! affects, CNOP's "CC", can only be 00 (NOP half word; staged CNOP rows
! print 000000.30 00).
!
! >>> CARD SERIALS. <<<  Shared: 260 (lines 6,7), 261 (8,9), 264
! (12,13,14), 271 (21,22,23).  Otherwise one per line, no gaps.

        SLC, (8)022267.40
!       -----------------------------------------------------------   ! line  1
!       THE DUMMY TABLES FOR THE UN-ASSIGNMENT OF THE REJECTED JOB    ! line  2
!       -----------------------------------------------------------   ! line  3
!                                                                     ! line  4
        CNOP                                                 ! line  5
TDSIO   VF,TCAT                                              ! line  6
        VF,TBIRD                                             ! line  7  -SAVE TAPES
        VF,TCOT                                              ! line  8
        VF,TBOID                                             ! line  9
!                                                                     ! line 10
TCAT    DRZ(N),8                                             ! line 11  -DUMMY UNIT AREA TABLE
        VF,TWORM                                             ! line 12
        VF,TWORM                                             ! line 13
        DD(BU,7),(16)01                                      ! line 14
!                                                                     ! line 15
TBIRD   DRZ(N),2                                             ! line 16  -DUMMY FILE AREA
        XW,(.31)3                                            ! line 17  -SET TO SAVE
        DRZ(N),1                                             ! line 18
!                                                                     ! line 19
TCOT    DRZ(N),8                                             ! line 20  -DUMMY UNIT AREA TABLE
        VF,TWORM                                             ! line 21
        VF,TWORM                                             ! line 22
        DD(BU,7),(16)01                                      ! line 23
!                                                                     ! line 24
TBOID   DRZ(N),5                                             ! line 25
!                                                                     ! line 26
TWORM   XW,(.26)3                                            ! line 27  -THE DUMMY REEL POOL --PROTECT
!                                                                     ! line 28

!SYM TDSIO  022270.00
!SYM TCAT   022272.00
!SYM TBIRD  022303.00
!SYM TCOT   022307.00
!SYM TBOID  022320.00
!SYM TWORM  022325.00
!CHECK 022267.40 | 000000.30 00 | line 5 CNOP (hex prints "CC", the open 0)
!CHECK 022270.00 | 022272.00+ | line 6 T DSIO VF,TCAT
!CHECK 022270.40 | 022303.00+ | line 7 VF,TBIRD
!CHECK 022271.00 | 022307.00+ | line 8 VF,TCOT
!CHECK 022271.40 | 022320.00+ | line 9 VF,TBOID
!CHECK 022302.00 | 022325.00+ | line 12 VF,TWORM
!CHECK 022302.40 | 022325.00+ | line 13 VF,TWORM
!CHECK 022302.71 | 001 | line 14 DD(BU,7),(16)01 | 7
!CHECK 022305.00 | 000000.00+ 000 140000 000000 | line 17 XW,(.31)3
!CHECK 022317.00 | 022325.00+ | line 21 VF,TWORM
!CHECK 022317.40 | 022325.00+ | line 22 VF,TWORM
!CHECK 022317.71 | 001 | line 23 DD(BU,7),(16)01 | 7
!CHECK 022325.00 | 000000.00+ 110 000000 000000 | line 27 T WORM XW,(.26)3
